:1rem;}.wsp-related-card{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;}.wsp-related-card a{font-weight:700;color:var(--global-palette1, #3182CE);text-decoration:none;}.wsp-related-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.wsp-related-card p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:#555;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call{background:#E0A83C !important;border:2px solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Kentucky Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: Rules for Selling a Rental</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Kentucky</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Kentucky Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Kentucky Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights sale</li><li>Turn the Kentucky Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Kentucky House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Kentucky statutes set the basic rules between landlords and tenants, including deposits, notices and what happens when a rental is sold.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Landlords requiring deposits must keep them in a separate account used only for that purpose and tell the tenant the location and account number. (KRS 383.580(1); <a href='https://apps.legislature.ky.gov/law/statutes/statute.aspx?id=35733' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Landlord must give the tenant a written pre-existing damage listing before the deposit is taken and a final damage listing at move-out; a landlord that lacks the separate account and both listings may not retain any part of the deposit. (KRS 383.580(2)-(4); <a href='https://apps.legislature.ky.gov/law/statutes/statute.aspx?id=35733' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>If refund is due and tenant owes no rent, landlord sends notice of the refund; if no response within 60 days of sending, landlord may retain the deposit. (KRS 383.580(7); <a href='https://apps.legislature.ky.gov/law/statutes/statute.aspx?id=35733' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Month-to-month tenancy: written notice at least 30 days before the periodic rental date specified; week-to-week: 7 days. (KRS 383.695(1),(2); <a href='https://apps.legislature.ky.gov/law/statutes/statute.aspx?id=35756' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Landlord must give at least 2 days&#x27; notice of intent to enter and may enter only at reasonable times, except in an emergency or where impracticable. (KRS 383.615(3); <a href='https://apps.legislature.ky.gov/law/statutes/statute.aspx?id=35740' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Kentucky?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Kentucky houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/kentucky-eviction-notice/'>Kentucky Eviction Notice: Types and Days</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/kentucky-guides-by-city-and-county/'>Kentucky guides by city and county</a><p>Every local guide we publish.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-kentucky/'>We buy houses in Kentucky</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><p><em>General information for Kentucky Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Kentucky\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-kentucky/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Kentucky Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/kentucky-landlord-tenant-law-tenant-rights/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Kentucky Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights", "rank_math_description": "Kentucky landlord tenant law and tenant rights: deposits, notices, entry and selling a rented house. Official sources only.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "kentucky tenant rights"}, {"slug": "kentucky-eviction-notice", "title": "Kentucky Eviction Notice Rules: Notice Types, Days and Selling the House", "content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>.wsp-hero{position:relative;margin:0 calc(-50vw + 50%);padding:5rem 1.5rem;background-image:none;background:linear-gradient(170deg,#12293f 0%,#0c1c2e 46%,#060c16 100%);overflow:hidden;}.wsp-hero-inner{max-width:1216px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:center;}.wsp-hero-left{text-align:center;}.wsp-hero-left h1{color:#fff;font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 1rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-hero-left h2{color:#fff;font-weight:300;font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 1rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-hero-left p{color:#fff;font-size:1rem;font-weight:300;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-btn-outline{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border:2px solid #fff;border-radius:30px;padding:.6rem 1.4rem;font-weight:600;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:.95rem;}.wsp-btn-outline:hover{background:#fff;color:#1A202C;}.wsp-hero-right iframe{width:100%;min-height:560px;border:none;border-radius:4px;}.wsp-wrap{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:3rem 1.5rem 4rem;}@media (max-width:900px){.wsp-hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.wsp-hero-left h1{font-size:2.1rem;}}.wsp-wrap h3{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #3182CE;border-radius:8px;padding:.9rem 1.25rem;margin:1.75rem 0 0;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#1A202C;}.wsp-wrap h3+p{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin:0 0 .25rem;color:#444;}.wsp-wrap table td{vertical-align:top;}.chb-cta p{margin:0}.wsp-related{margin:2.5rem 0 1rem}.wsp-related h2{font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:1rem;font-weight:600;}.wsp-related-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1rem;}.wsp-related-card{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;}.wsp-related-card a{font-weight:700;color:var(--global-palette1, #3182CE);text-decoration:none;}.wsp-related-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.wsp-related-card p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:#555;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call{background:#E0A83C !important;border:2px solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Kentucky Eviction Notice Rules: Notice Types, Days and Selling the House</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Kentucky</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Kentucky Eviction Notice Rules: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Kentucky Eviction Notice Rules sale</li><li>Turn the Kentucky Eviction Notice Rules offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Kentucky House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Kentucky law requires a landlord to give a specific written notice before filing an eviction, and the number of days depends on the reason.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Nonpayment: landlord may terminate if tenant fails to pay within 7 days after written notice of nonpayment and intent to terminate. (KRS 383.660(2); <a href='https://apps.legislature.ky.gov/law/statutes/statute.aspx?id=35749' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Lease violation: written notice that the agreement will terminate not less than 14 days after receipt; if the breach is remedied before that date the agreement does not terminate; same breach recurring within 6 months allows 14 days&#x27; notice without cure. (KRS 383.660(1); <a href='https://apps.legislature.ky.gov/law/statutes/statute.aspx?id=35749' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>No-cause, month-to-month: 30 days&#x27; written notice before the periodic rental date. (KRS 383.695(2); <a href='https://apps.legislature.ky.gov/law/statutes/statute.aspx?id=35756' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Tenancy begun after a written lease ends may be terminated by 10 days&#x27; written notice; if rent is unpaid 10 days after due, landlord may terminate without notice. (KRS 383.695(3); <a href='https://apps.legislature.ky.gov/law/statutes/statute.aspx?id=35756' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Willful holdover: landlord may recover up to 3 months&#x27; rent or threefold actual damages (whichever greater) plus attorney&#x27;s fees. (KRS 383.695(4); <a href='https://apps.legislature.ky.gov/law/statutes/statute.aspx?id=35756' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Kentucky?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Kentucky houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/kentucky-landlord-tenant-law-tenant-rights/'>Kentucky Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/kentucky-guides-by-city-and-county/'>Kentucky guides by city and county</a><p>Every local guide we publish.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-kentucky/'>We buy houses in Kentucky</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><p><em>General information for Kentucky Eviction Notice Rules, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Kentucky\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-kentucky/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Kentucky Eviction Notice: Types and Days\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/kentucky-eviction-notice/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Kentucky Eviction Notice: Types and Days", "rank_math_description": "Kentucky eviction notice rules: notice types, required days, which court hears the case and selling a rental. Official sources.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "kentucky eviction notice"}]